            "image": "shopify://shop_images/rs_w_365_h_365_cg_true.webp",
            "title": "OUR TEAM",
            "text": "<p>Thumb Fin was designed as a way to add a thumb rest to a bass or guitar without altering the instrument. Its ergonomic shape gives your thumb a relaxed, natural place to rest, so you can focus on your technique. The best bass thumb rest you'll ever use.</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_JCdp47": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/IMG_8451.jpg",
            "title": "OUR MISSION",
            "text": "<p>Interested in trying a thumb rest but don't want to alter your instrument? We've got you covered. Thumb Fin lets you place your thumb rest where you want, when you want, and move it whenever you like. It mounts by suction, so it works across basses and guitars instead of fitting only one model.</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_ygVdPa": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/ThumbFin-logo.png",
            "title": "PATENTED",
            "text": "<p>Patented as the first suction-cup thumb rest, Thumb Fin was engineered to let you choose exactly where your thumb sits. Its ergonomic design gives your thumb a comfortable, natural resting point, so you can focus on your technique.</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        }
